OL,3,AHyrox athlete who soiled herself in
OL,4,Arace tells BBC she put others at risk
OL,5,Abut backlash was traumatic
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Australian athlete has admitted
OL,8,Fputting others at risk by continuing to
OL,9,Frace after soiling herself during an
OL,10,Fendurance sports event.
OL,12,FSpeaking exclusively to the BBC ahead
OL,13,Fof her return to the sport, Joanna
OL,14,FWietrzyk suggested her determination to
OL,15,Fwin the Hyrox race in Beijing in
OL,16,FSeptember had clouded her judgement:
OL,17,F"It was my decision to continue racing
OL,18,Fso I take full responsibility for
OL,19,Fthat."
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
