OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHyrox athlete who soiled herself in
OL,4,Arace tells BBC she put others at risk
OL,5,Abut backlash was traumatic
OL,6,
OL,7,FChallenged over why she carried on, she
OL,8,Fsaid: "I didn't really think about
OL,9,Fthose around me... the decision that I
OL,10,Fmade in hindsight was the wrong
OL,11,Fdecision and I'm truly sorry for
OL,12,Feveryone that I did affect."
OL,14,FThe 24-year-old said that the
OL,15,Fexperience and subsequent backlash was
OL,16,F"traumatic". She also said she had
OL,17,Fconsidered walking away from the sport,
OL,18,Fin which she holds a world record.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
